  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (A): Under IRC Section 1033(b), the basis of replacement property equals its cost minus deferred gain. Kim''s realized gain is $300,000 ($900,000 minus $600,000 basis). Since $50,000 was not reinvested ($900,000 minus $850,000), only $50,000 is recognized and $250,000 is deferred. The replacement basis is $850,000 minus $250,000 = $550,000.
