  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (B): Under IRC Section 250(a)(1)(B), the GILTI deduction drops from 50% to 37.5% for tax years beginning after December 31, 2025, as originally enacted by the TCJA. This reduction increases the effective tax rate on GILTI inclusions from 10.5% to approximately 13.125%.
Wrong (A): The 50% deduction applied for tax years beginning before 2026 and is no longer available for the 2026 tax year.
